<title>USA: Montgomery Cty USD 447, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</title>
<headline>Montgomery Cty USD 447, Kan., won by UMB Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>UMB Bank said it won $3.2 million of Montgomery Cty Unified Sch Dist No. 447, Kan., general obligation school building bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.42 percent.</p>
